# OPIc Sample Answer — Day46

## Electronic Device Problem

> A few months ago, my phone suddenly stopped working while I was outside. The screen froze, and I couldn't use any apps. I wasn't sure what to do at first. The first thing I did was restart the phone, but it didn't work. After that, I searched for a solution online using my friend's phone. Luckily, I found out that the problem could be caused by an outdated software version. So I updated the software when I got home. Eventually, my phone started working normally again. I was pretty relieved because I use my phone for almost everything.

---

## Useful Structure

> **A few months ago,...**
> → 배경

> **The first thing I did was...**
> → 첫 번째 행동

> **After that,...**
> → 다음 행동

> **Luckily,...**
> → 긍정적인 전환

> **Eventually,...**
> → 해결

> **I was pretty relieved because...**
> → 감정 + 이유

### 오늘의 핵심 문장

> **The first thing I did was restart the phone, but it didn't work.**
